{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose one of three game modes:</strong> develop a legitimate career as a train driver, fight for survival at all costs, or take a job for the Soviet mafia and discover the dark story of the railway underworld.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.poster.avif?t=1765006572\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.webm?t=1765006572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/extras/d04e793f13dbf1fa11ec3fa963de1766.mp4?t=1765006572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>  </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the grim realities of the late '80s, where a powerful locomotive is your home, means of transport, and tool for earning money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation of the iconic VL10 locomotive</strong> - choose between simplified and realistic controls and procedures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Railway traffic</strong> - obey signs and signals, avoid derailments and damage to the locomotive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repairs and maintenance</strong> - monitor part wear and replace components before disaster strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy and trade</strong> - make money transporting cargo. Buy food, tools, locomotive parts, and weapons. Sell hunting trophies, meat, loot, and scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting and combat</strong> - use weapons for hunting, self-defense, or robbery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Law and order</strong> - the Militia keeps order, and civilians defend their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival system</strong> - control hunger, thirst, illness, hypothermia, alcohol, and hangover levels to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and day-night cycle</strong> - blizzards, night, and fog affect visibility. Low temperatures can kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route</strong> - about 840 km in 1:1 scale, with many places and activities to discover.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cbbfe5b4dc67f1a51f57edf2bde62833c70bff37.jpg","localized_name":"Serial Killer","name":"Serial Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/998400/cbbfe5b4dc67f1a51f57edf2bde62833c70bff37.jpg"},{"icon":"0776c10c1ad2a96ab8b2fbd1334a0ae630ca88a3.jpg","localized_name":"Terrorist","name":"Terrorist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/998400/0776c10c1ad2a96ab8b2fbd1334a0ae630ca88a3.jpg"},{"icon":"2af01fb43ed7a9765cc27cd7619d180f3f4a3ede.jpg","localized_name":"Stabber","name":"Stabber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/998400/2af01fb43ed7a9765cc27cd7619d180f3f4a3ede.jpg"},{"icon":"31d6025eb5ee9eeb2eaff02fef5fa85c393a41ab.jpg","localized_name":"Drunken Master","name":"Drunken Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/998400/31d6025eb5ee9eeb2eaff02fef5fa85c393a41ab.jpg"},{"icon":"15ea36449f6efdfe76c57c2d2ffce1073b50c113.jpg","localized_name":"Be Careful Where You Shoot","name":"Be Careful Where You Shoot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/998400/15ea36449f6efdfe76c57c2d2ffce1073b50c113.jpg"},{"icon":"01139aa7e62f04dfc504d6ac3fc4ac94c8a50fb3.jpg","localized_name":"Sharpshooter","name":"Sharpshooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/998