rst, illness, hypothermia, alcohol, and hangover levels to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and day-night cycle</strong> - blizzards, night, and fog affect visibility. Low temperatures can kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route</strong> - about 840 km in 1:1 scale, with many places and activities to discover.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pentacle"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/998400/header.jpg?t=1765006572","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/998400/709811/665b45909b881036b98a78cd29521685574ca1b2/1750605387/dash_av1.mpd?t=1717616483","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/998400/709811/665b45909b881036b98a78cd29521685574ca1b2/1750605387/dash_h264.mpd?t=1717616483","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/998400/709811/665b45909b881036b98a78cd29521685574ca1b2/1750605387/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1717616483","id":257028632,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257028632/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1717616483"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/998400/617464/860afcf918122b156dccdc892eda5dc8ff9d7ee4/1750605383/dash_av1.mpd?t=1697035800","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/998400/617464/860afcf918122b156dccdc892eda5dc8ff9d7ee4/1750605383/dash_h264.mpd?t=1697035800","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/998400/617464/860afcf918122b156dccdc892eda5dc8ff9d7ee4/1750605383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1697035800","id":256975324,"name":"Trans-Siberian5min","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap